The easiest way to install git-annex on Android is using the [[termux]]
package.

It's also possible to install git-annex manually, using
the [[Linux_standalone]] build, run inside the Termux or Nix-On-Droid
app. [[Manual installation instructions here|/Android]].

The old git-annex Android app,
is no longer bEing updated, details about it are at [[oldapp]].
